# Changelog

## 0.1.0 - 2026-07-29

- Added public dataset documentation and machine-readable metadata templates.
- Added task-condition, treatment-arm, visit, and field dictionaries.
- Added controlled-access and Data Use Agreement guidance.
- Documented the anonymous representative reviewer-package route.
- Excluded participant EEG, clinical records, source identifiers, and private mappings from Git.

